/// `dmtools compile` — builds a versioned agent pack — Dart port of the
/// Java `CompileCommand` (dm.ai #595).
///
/// Parses `entry.json` plus `--agent-root` / `--version` /
/// `--versions-file` / `--out` / `--source-commit` and delegates to
